{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮2days"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事終了しました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これにて全ツアー完結です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏が終わった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駆け抜けた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/09/01/8702466/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮1日目は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨ザーザーの中でのライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん風邪は大丈夫かな？>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、雨の中やってるってことがむしろ楽しくなっちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野外ライブならではっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日はからあげ姉妹で影ナレしたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/09/01/8702466/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終演後は、らじらー生中継へ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの余韻＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな中3組(ひめたん・ちーちゃん)とオリラジさんが一緒だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は寝るまでずっとテンション高かった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて、神宮2日目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨はほぼ止んでました！ありがたやっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアー最終日であるこの日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国各地を巡った記憶とか、みんなで練習した思い出とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな思いが集結して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しみの忘れ